Answering one of the FAQs on his website asked “what makes you think we can end extreme poverty?””
Global Citizen replied: “It’s a tough route and it will take time—there will sometimes we’ll be disappointed and discouraged.
However, just like the previous civil and antiapartheid rights, we will succeed, because when we work together we will grow stronger.
