Britain will always be open to anyone who wants to stay, work and build life here.
However, it is unfair because it is very convenient for individuals who do not live in the UK, as well as overseas-based companies to buy a home compared to the hard-working British population here.
For too many people, the dream of owning a house is very far away, and the fact of living all over the place with humiliation is a reality.
